/private/tmp/pk-audit-20261002-py312/bin/python -m tools.pk_fixture_cli --help
pk_fixture_cli: CLI entrypoint for pkdummy-harness

Usage:
  python -m tools.pk_fixture_cli <command> [args...]
  (run from the repository root)

Commands:
  doctor               Check local Python/R/Quarto/simPop readiness.
  run                  Run a harness YAML config.
  workflow             Run post-simulation validate/sample/SDTM-like/analysis workflow.
  validate-simulation  Recalculate AUC/Cmax/Tmax/t1/2 from sim_full.csv.
  validate-config      Validate a run_harness YAML config.
  sample-timepoints    Sample dense simulation output at nominal clinical times.
  make-sdtm            Generate limited SDTM-like DM/VS/LB/EX/PC CSVs.
  make-analysis        Generate ADPC/NCA/PopPK smoke-test input CSVs.
  downstream-smoke     Run downstream NCA/PopPK parser smoke checks.
  site-adapter         Generate site-specific adapter CSVs from a YAML mapping.
  external-validation  Probe or run optional Phoenix/NONMEM/nlmixr2 profiles.
  manifest-viewer      Render a MANIFEST.yml to a static HTML viewer.
  examples-check       Regenerate versioned examples in a temp dir and compare.
  audit-library        Read-only internal-first library priority audit.
  cdisc-reference      Fetch optional CDISC DM/EX reference fixtures.

Examples:
  python -m tools.pk_fixture_cli doctor
  python -m tools.pk_fixture_cli run harness_examples/demo_set.yml
  python -m tools.pk_fixture_cli workflow --sim-full outputs/<run>/raw/sim_full.csv --drug aciclovir --times 0,1,2 --out-dir outputs/<run>/workflow

Boundary:
  Generated data are workflow fixtures, not clinical inference or dose-selection evidence.
